WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.253 --> 00:00:13.481
"Furbit's trying to eat me!"

2
00:00:13.781 --> 00:00:14.482
Roxy cried.

3
00:00:14.502 --> 00:00:15.783
"Oh no!"

4
00:00:16.203 --> 00:00:17.064
Officer Wells said.

5
00:00:17.805 --> 00:00:19.466
Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

6
00:00:19.866 --> 00:00:23.870
Whiz-hoo! They bounced off Furbit's teeth and hit a wall.

7
00:00:26.031 --> 00:00:27.032
Roxy saw smoke.

8
00:00:28.213 --> 00:00:30.095
"Don't do that!"

9
00:00:30.455 --> 00:00:31.416
Dr. Chen shouted.

10
00:00:32.076 --> 00:00:34.697
"You'll burn a hole in the space station!"

11
00:00:34.717 --> 00:00:37.299
"Sorry!" Roxy said.

12
00:00:38.059 --> 00:00:40.460
Furbit tossed Roxy into his wide mouth.

13
00:00:45.483 --> 00:00:46.483
Roxy was in the dark.

14
00:00:50.765 --> 00:00:52.126
She punched and kicked.

15
00:00:55.187 --> 00:00:56.108
Furbit rolled around.

16
00:01:00.348 --> 00:01:02.109
Next Roxy tried her super strength.

17
00:01:03.590 --> 00:01:05.411
She pushed Furbit's mouth open.

18
00:01:06.491 --> 00:01:07.432
Roxy dived out.

19
00:01:07.452 --> 00:01:12.074
"Whew!" Now Furbit looked ill.

20
00:01:12.094 --> 00:01:15.416
"Furbit, are you okay?"

21
00:01:15.916 --> 00:01:17.677
Roxy flew up and patted him on the back.

22
00:01:17.697 --> 00:01:20.319
"Furbit?" Braaap!

23
00:01:20.779 --> 00:01:21.980
Furbit burped loudly.

24
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.702
"Whoa!" Roxy cried.

25
00:01:28.023 --> 00:01:29.924
A computer flew out of Furbit's mouth.

26
00:01:31.316 --> 00:01:32.497
Several phones followed.

27
00:01:33.757 --> 00:01:35.178
Dr. Chen grabbed a phone.

28
00:01:35.198 --> 00:01:38.319
"The phone still works!

29
00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:41.681
We can contact the Space Agency now!"

30
00:01:42.941 --> 00:01:44.062
Furbit burped some more.

31
00:01:46.203 --> 00:01:48.784
Sleeping bags, tools, and other items flew out.

32
00:01:50.024 --> 00:01:51.185
Furbit grew smaller.

33
00:01:52.585 --> 00:01:54.086
Officer Wells looked at the items.

34
00:01:54.106 --> 00:01:56.707
"A lot of this stuff is broken."

35
00:01:57.628 --> 00:01:58.288
He bit his lip.

36
00:01:59.092 --> 00:02:01.133
"I hope Commander Smith doesn't get too mad."

37
00:02:01.153 --> 00:02:03.675
"Where is he, anyway?"

38
00:02:03.995 --> 00:02:04.955
another astronaut said.

39
00:02:06.536 --> 00:02:08.317
Furbit let out one last burp.

40
00:02:09.018 --> 00:02:11.879
Braap! A man flew out of the creature's mouth.

41
00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:14.601
By now Furbit was tiny again.

42
00:02:19.663 --> 00:02:22.645
Roxy gasped when she realized who the man was.

43
00:02:22.665 --> 00:02:24.826
"You're Commander Smith!"

44
00:02:26.367 --> 00:02:27.828
"Ugh!" the commander said.

45
00:02:28.884 --> 00:02:30.045
"That was terrible."

46
00:02:30.845 --> 00:02:31.866
He looked over at Roxy.

47
00:02:31.886 --> 00:02:33.888
"Oh! Rocket Girl!

48
00:02:34.168 --> 00:02:35.228
Thanks for saving me."

49
00:02:36.809 --> 00:02:39.511
"No problem, Detective—I mean, Commander."

50
00:02:40.492 --> 00:02:42.113
Roxy laughed.

51
00:02:42.133 --> 00:02:43.814
"You look just like your brother!"

52
00:02:43.834 --> 00:02:46.836
"Yep," Commander Smith said.

53
00:02:46.856 --> 00:02:49.718
"He and I are exactly alike."

54
00:02:50.839 --> 00:02:52.080
He looked around and laughed.

55
00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:55.322
"What a mess!

56
00:02:55.762 --> 00:02:58.064
Who let that creature into the space station?"

57
00:03:00.592 --> 00:03:01.933
Officer Wells bit his lip.

58
00:03:01.953 --> 00:03:04.334
"Uh, it was me."

59
00:03:05.374 --> 00:03:06.435
Commander Smith shrugged.

60
00:03:07.155 --> 00:03:09.056
"Well, everything's okay now.

61
00:03:09.816 --> 00:03:11.857
This was kind of funny, actually!"

62
00:03:13.278 --> 00:03:14.418
Roxy raised an eyebrow.

63
00:03:15.259 --> 00:03:18.080
"You and your brother aren't exactly alike, Commander."

64
00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:21.721
"And you!"

65
00:03:22.942 --> 00:03:24.102
Roxy patted Furbit.

66
00:03:24.122 --> 00:03:27.244
"You need to go back to where you came from."

67
00:03:30.004 --> 00:03:31.585
She put Furbit into his spaceship.

68
00:03:35.767 --> 00:03:36.908
She carried it outside.

69
00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:52.036
Furbit!" Roxy waved as the spaceship zoomed away.

70
00:03:56.639 --> 00:03:58.720
Roxy returned to the playground and found her friends.

71
00:03:59.448 --> 00:04:00.809
They were still picking up litter.

72
00:04:00.829 --> 00:04:03.332
"Hey, Terrell," Roxy said.

73
00:04:03.352 --> 00:04:07.075
"I met a creature that could eat all of this trash."

74
00:04:07.095 --> 00:04:09.238
"Why didn't you bring it here?"

75
00:04:09.618 --> 00:04:10.319
Terrell asked.

76
00:04:11.299 --> 00:04:12.100
Roxy shrugged.

77
00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:15.884
"He could also eat things like cars—and people!"

78
00:04:16.805 --> 00:04:18.026
She picked up a trash bag.

79
00:04:18.787 --> 00:04:19.828
"Let's get to work!"
